      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the safety_threshold.py file that applies category thresholds to decide whether to allow text, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. Given the nature of the task, I will use Amazon Comprehend's custom classification feature, which allows for the application of custom thresholds to determine text safety. The integration will be identifiable through the use of the boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and the specific service client for Amazon Comprehend. </thinking>\n",
