      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `redact_unsafe.py` that flags or redacts unsafe spans from text using a concrete external provider, I will choose the Amazon Comprehend service, which is a natural language processing (NLP) service that uses machine learning to find insights and relationships in text. Specifically, I will use the `DetectToxicContent` API from Amazon Comprehend to identify unsafe content. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and the use of the `comprehend` client. </thinking>\n",
