      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the `moderate_batch.py` file, I need to choose a concrete external provider for text moderation. One widely used service is the Perspective API by Jigsaw, which provides a machine learning model to detect toxic and harmful content in text. I will use the `perspective-api` Python package to interact with this API. The code will include the import of the `perspective_api` package, which is a clear signal of the external provider being used. </thinking>\n",
